# Dark Souls II (PC, the 2022 build) — lifter manifest.
#
# entry <va>            a function Ghidra missed (indirect-branch target)
# replace <va> Name     define f_<VA> in C++ instead of the lifted body
# hook <va> <end>       patch the byte range (unlifted, replaced by a hook)
# code <va> <end>       code in a section not marked executable
#
# Arxan (the anti-tamper wrapper) has code in the ends of .rdata, .reloc
# and .idata besides its own .text, and makes those sections executable
# when it starts.
